        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> This change doesn't really ensure that autocommand from 'mini.snippets' is created before autocommands from 'blink.cmp' and/or 'nvim-cmp'.\r\n\r\nTrue. I do think it's reasonable to add the following constraint to the help: Please load `mini.snippets` before the completion engine.",
